---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const evidence = [
  { number: '01', name: 'Inspect a real diff', context: 'VS CODE / SOURCE CONTROL', detail: 'Review staged files line by line before a commit becomes part of your history.', image: 'https://code.visualstudio.com/assets/docs/sourcecontrol/overview/overview.png', alt: 'Official VS Code Source Control screenshot showing changed files and a side-by-side diff editor.', href: 'https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/sourcecontrol/overview', link: 'VS Code source control' },
  { number: '02', name: 'Define the change', context: 'GITHUB / ISSUES', detail: 'Describe the goal and acceptance criteria before writing the implementation.', image: 'https://docs.github.com/assets/images/help/issues/issue-title-body.png', alt: 'Official GitHub screenshot showing the issue title and body form.', href: 'https://docs.github.com/en/issues/tracking-your-work-with-issues/using-issues/creating-an-issue', link: 'GitHub issues' },
  { number: '03', name: 'Read the workflow log', context: 'GITHUB / ACTIONS', detail: 'Locate the failed step, read the first useful error, and follow the evidence.', image: 'https://docs.github.com/assets/images/help/repository/actions-quickstart-log-detail.png', alt: 'Official GitHub Actions screenshot showing an expanded workflow job log.', href: 'https://docs.github.com/en/actions/how-tos/monitor-workflows/use-workflow-run-logs', link: 'Actions logs' }
];
const styles = [
  {name:'Editorial',slug:'editorial',meta:'STORY FIRST',copy:'A considered typographic system with room for your story and experience.',tone:'paper'},
  {name:'Developer',slug:'developer',meta:'PROJECT FIRST',copy:'Dark surfaces, technical details, and work samples up front.',tone:'dark'},
  {name:'Professional',slug:'professional',meta:'SIGNAL FIRST',copy:'A sharp, recruiter-friendly profile built for fast scanning.',tone:'blue'}
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Git & GitHub · Workshop 01" description="A hands-on engineering workshop. Build a portfolio, review a change, and publish a working site with Git, GitHub, VS Code, and Copilot.">
<div class="new-home">
  <section class="tech-hero">
    <div class="hero-gridlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="hero-overline"><span class="live-dot"></span> WICHITA STATE / MIS CLUB <i>•</i> WORKSHOP 01</div>
      <h1>Build a portfolio.<br/><span class="hero-gradient">Publish it with GitHub.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-dek">Start with a portfolio project, make a change, review it with Git, and publish it with GitHub Pages. You’ll use GitHub, VS Code, and Copilot along the way.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="action-primary" href={base+'student-guide/'}>Start the walkthrough <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="action-quiet" href={base+'slides/'}>View the slides <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-specs">
        <div><strong>03<span>h</span></strong><small>WORKSHOP LENGTH</small></div>
        <div><strong>06</strong><small>WALKTHROUGH STEPS</small></div>
        <div><strong>01</strong><small>PUBLISH A SITE</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Illustration of a change moving through Git, code review, automated checks, and a live website">
      <div class="visual-orbit orbit-a"></div><div class="visual-orbit orbit-b"></div>
      <div class="orbit-core"><span class="core-mark">⌘</span><span class="core-caption">FROM EDIT<br/>TO PUBLISHED</span></div>
      <div class="visual-node node-code"><span class="node-icon">{ }</span><span><b>Local change</b><small>VS CODE · DIFF</small></span><i>01</i></div>
      <div class="visual-node node-review"><span class="node-icon">⑂</span><span><b>Code review</b><small>GITHUB · PR</small></span><i>02</i></div>
      <div class="visual-node node-check"><span class="node-icon">✓</span><span><b>Automated checks</b><small>ACTIONS · BUILD</small></span><i>03</i></div>
      <div class="visual-node node-live"><span class="live-spark"></span><span><b>Published site</b><small>GITHUB PAGES</small></span><i>LIVE</i></div>
      <svg class="orbit-connectors" viewBox="0 0 600 500" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M170 100 C255 70 340 90 410 146" stroke="#4a4a4a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 7"/>
        <path d="M425 174 C485 240 463 300 412 342" stroke="#4a4a4a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 7"/>
        <path d="M375 371 C288 430 190 398 151 337" stroke="#4a4a4a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 7"/>
        <path d="M130 306 C83 238 96 156 153 123" stroke="#4a4a4a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 7"/>
        <circle cx="410" cy="146" r="4" fill="#FFDB00"/><circle cx="412" cy="342" r="4" fill="#BDBDBD"/><circle cx="151" cy="337" r="4" fill="#FFDB00"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="visual-caption"><span>PUBLISHING PROCESS</span><span><b></b> EDIT → REVIEW → PUBLISH</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottomline"><span>GIT → REVIEW → PUBLISH</span><span>Follow the change from <code>git status</code> to the published site.</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="signal-strip" aria-label="Workshop tools">
    <span>TOOLS IN THIS WORKSHOP</span><b>GIT</b><i>×</i><b>GITHUB</b><i>×</i><b>VS CODE</b><i>×</i><b>COPILOT</b><i>×</i><b>GITHUB PAGES</b>
    <span class="signal-note">USED IN THIS WORKSHOP</span>
  </section>

  <section class="section-flow">
    <div class="section-rail"><span>01 / THE STEPS</span><span>WHAT YOU’LL DO</span></div>
    <div class="flow-intro">
      <h2>From a local edit<br/><em>to a live website.</em></h2>
      <p>You’ll start with the project on your computer, make one change, then use GitHub to review it and publish the site.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pipeline">
      <a class="pipeline-step" href={base+'student-guide/#step-1'}><span class="pipeline-no">01</span><span class="pipeline-icon">⌁</span><span class="pipeline-content"><b>Set up</b><small>Get the project running locally.</small></span><span class="pipeline-arrow">↗</span></a>
      <a class="pipeline-step" href={base+'student-guide/#step-4'}><span class="pipeline-no">02</span><span class="pipeline-icon">{ }</span><span class="pipeline-content"><b>Make a change</b><small>Edit, stage, and inspect the diff.</small></span><span class="pipeline-arrow">↗</span></a>
      <a class="pipeline-step" href={base+'student-guide/#step-5'}><span class="pipeline-no">03</span><span class="pipeline-icon">⑂</span><span class="pipeline-content"><b>Review it</b><small>Commit, push, and open a pull request.</small></span><span class="pipeline-arrow">↗</span></a>
      <a class="pipeline-step" href={base+'student-guide/#step-6'}><span class="pipeline-no">04</span><span class="pipeline-icon">↗</span><span class="pipeline-content"><b>Publish it</b><small>Pass the build and test the live URL.</small></span><span class="pipeline-arrow">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-footnote"><span class="footnote-mark">i</span><p>Inspect the diff before committing. If the build fails, read the log. After publishing, open the URL and check the page.</p><a href={base+'workshop/'}>See the 3-hour agenda ↗</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="tools-section">
    <div class="section-rail"><span>02 / THE TOOLS</span><span>SCREENSHOTS FROM OFFICIAL DOCUMENTATION</span></div>
    <div class="tools-heading"><div><h2>These are the tools<br/><em>you’ll use in class.</em></h2></div><p>These screenshots come from the official documentation. Use them to get oriented, then follow the steps in your own GitHub repository and VS Code window.</p></div>
    <div class="tool-showcase">
      {evidence.map((item, i) => <article class={'tool-feature tool-feature-'+item.number}>
        <div class="tool-screen">
          <div class="tool-window-bar"><span class="window-lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>{item.context}</span><a href={item.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">SOURCE ↗</a></div>
          <a href={item.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="tool-image-link" aria-label={'Open '+item.link}><img src={item.image} alt={item.alt} loading="lazy"/></a>
          <div class="tool-screen-foot"><span>REFERENCE / {item.number}</span><span>OFFICIAL UI</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-description"><span class="tool-index">{item.number}</span><div><h3>{item.name}</h3><p>{item.detail}</p><a href={item.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{item.link} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
      </article>)}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="build-section">
    <div class="build-left"><div class="section-rail light"><span>03 / YOUR STARTING LAYOUT</span><span>CHOOSE A LAYOUT</span></div><h2>Choose a layout.<br/><em>Then make it yours.</em></h2><p>Start with one of these portfolio layouts. Replace the sample content with your own details, then change the design as you learn.</p><a class="action-primary" href={base+'designs/'}>Compare the portfolio layouts <span>↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="style-stack">
      {styles.map((style) => <a class={'style-row style-'+style.tone} href={base+'designs/'}>
        <span class="style-index">{style.slug==='editorial'?'01':style.slug==='developer'?'02':'03'}</span>
        <span class="style-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-head"></span><span class="art-line"></span><span class="art-line short"></span><span class="art-block"></span><span class="art-block second"></span></span>
        <span class="style-copy"><small>{style.meta}</small><b>{style.name}</b><span>{style.copy}</span></span>
        <span class="style-open">↗</span>
      </a>)}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="outcomes-section">
    <div class="section-rail"><span>04 / WHEN YOU FINISH</span><span>WHAT YOU’LL HAVE</span></div>
    <div class="outcomes-heading"><h2>What you’ll finish<br/><em>with.</em></h2><p>You should finish with your own repository, a change you’ve reviewed, and a published page you’ve opened in a browser. If deployment fails, the guide shows you where to look.</p></div>
    <div class="outcome-grid">
      <div class="outcome-item"><span class="outcome-number">01</span><div><b>Your own repository</b><p>Your portfolio files and their commit history, stored in a GitHub repository.</p></div><span class="outcome-status">CREATED</span></div>
      <div class="outcome-item"><span class="outcome-number">02</span><div><b>A change you’ve reviewed</b><p>A pull request with a clear diff and a commit message that describes the change.</p></div><span class="outcome-status">REVIEWED</span></div>
      <div class="outcome-item"><span class="outcome-number">03</span><div><b>A published page</b><p>A public URL that you’ve opened and checked. If the deployment failed, you’ll know which log to inspect.</p></div><span class="outcome-status status-live"><span></span> VERIFIED</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="cta-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">WSU<br/>/ MIS<br/>001</div>
    <div><span class="cta-kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> NEXT STEP</span><h2>Start by opening<br/>the project.</h2><p>Keep the walkthrough open while you work in VS Code. It covers each step and the common errors you might run into.</p></div>
    <a class="action-primary" href={base+'student-guide/'}>Open the walkthrough <span>↗</span></a>
  </section>
  <div class="home-legal"><span>WICHITA STATE UNIVERSITY · MIS CLUB</span><span>WORKSHOP 01 — GIT / GITHUB / DELIVERY</span></div>
</div>

<style>
.new-home{--nh-ink:#111111;--nh-muted:#bdbdbd;--nh-accent:#FFDB00;--nh-gray:#bdbdbd;--nh-yellow:#FFDB00;color:#111111}
.tech-hero{position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;background:#050505;color:#FFFFFF;padding:64px max(28px,calc((100vw - 1180px)/2)) 0;min-height:690px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.04fr .96fr;gap:20px;align-items:center}
.hero-gridlines{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:.17;background-image:linear-gradient(#555555 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#555555 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:52px 52px;mask-image:linear-gradient(100deg,#000,transparent 82%)}
.tech-hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;z-index:-1;width:650px;height:650px;right:-120px;top:-200px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#171717 0%,#080808 34%,transparent 70%)}
.hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:10px 0 34px;max-width:670px}
.hero-overline,.hero-specs small,.hero-bottomline,.visual-caption,.tool-window-bar,.tool-screen-foot,.section-rail,.style-copy small,.outcome-status,.home-legal,.cta-kicker{font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.11em}
.hero-overline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#BDBDBD}.hero-overline i{font-style:normal;color:#777777}
.live-dot{width:7px;height:7px;flex:0 0 7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--nh-accent);box-shadow:0 0 14px #FFDB0066;display:inline-block}
.tech-hero h1{font:600 clamp(48px,6.1vw,82px)/.99 'Titillium Web',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:27px 0 25px;max-width:720px;color:#ffffff}
.hero-gradient{background:linear-gradient(102deg,#ffffff 8%,#E5E5E5 48%,#FFDB00 95%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero-dek{max-width:590px;font:17px/1.72 'Roboto',sans-serif;color:#bdbdbd;margin:0}
.hero-ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:13px;margin-top:30px;align-items:center}
.action-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:30px;background:var(--nh-accent);color:#111111;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 18px;font:700 13px 'Roboto',sans-serif;border:1px solid var(--nh-accent);transition:transform .18s ease,background .18s ease;min-height:48px}
.action-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:#FFE766}
.action-quiet{display:inline-flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;color:#F2F2F2;text-decoration:none;font:600 12px 'Roboto',sans-serif;padding:12px 0}
.action-quiet:hover{color:#bdbdbd}
.hero-specs{display:flex;gap:0;margin-top:46px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #333333;max-width:580px}
.hero-specs>div{display:grid;gap:5px;padding:0 25px;border-left:1px solid #333333}.hero-specs>div:first-child{padding-left:0;border:0}
.hero-specs strong{font:600 24px 'Titillium Web',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#fff}.hero-specs strong span{font-size:14px;color:#FFDB00;margin-left:3px}
.hero-specs small{font-size:8px;color:#999999;letter-spacing:.08em}
.hero-visual{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:620px;aspect-ratio:1.1;margin:0 auto 22px;display:grid;place-items:center;isolation:isolate}
.hero-visual:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:6%;border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:50%;opacity:.65}
.hero-visual:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:17%;border:1px dashed #4A4A4A;border-radius:50%;opacity:.62}
.visual-orbit{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #333333;transform:rotate(-25deg)}
.orbit-a{width:80%;height:48%;}.orbit-b{width:67%;height:80%;transform:rotate(44deg)}
.orbit-core{width:148px;height:148px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 20%,#222222,#171717 69%);border:1px solid #555555;box-shadow:0 0 0 12px #00000020,0 0 65px #FFFFFF1B;z-index:1}
.core-mark{font:600 36px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:var(--nh-accent)}
.core-caption{font:9px/1.45 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.15em;text-align:center;color:#BDBDBD}
.visual-node{position:absolute;z-index:3;display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:center;background:#171717;border:1px solid #383838;box-shadow:0 12px 26px #0004;padding:12px 13px;min-width:220px}
.node-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;background:#222222;color:#bdbdbd;width:33px;height:33px;font:14px 'DM Mono',monospace}
.visual-node b{display:block;font:600 12px 'Roboto',sans-serif;color:#F2F2F2}.visual-node small{display:block;margin-top:4px;font:8px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#aaaaaa}.visual-node i{margin-left:auto;font:9px 'DM Mono',monospace;font-style:normal;color:#A6A6A6}
.node-code{top:10%;left:2%}.node-review{top:22%;right:-2%}.node-check{bottom:20%;right:0}.node-live{bottom:7%;left:6%}
.node-live{border-color:#FFDB00}.node-live .node-icon{background:#222222;color:var(--nh-accent)}
.live-spark{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--nh-accent);box-shadow:0 0 12px #FFDB0080;margin:0 12px}
.node-live b{margin-right:12px}.node-live i{color:var(--nh-accent)}
.orbit-connectors{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:2;pointer-events:none}
.visual-caption{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:2%;right:2%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #333333;color:#999999;font-size:8px}
.visual-caption span:last-child{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.visual-caption b{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--nh-accent)}
.hero-bottomline{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;border-top:1px solid #333333;color:#999999;padding:18px 0;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.13em}
.hero-bottomline code{color:#FFDB00;font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace;background:#182331;padding:4px 6px}.bottom-arrow{color:var(--nh-accent);font-size:14px;margin-left:8px}
.signal-strip{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:21px max(28px,calc((100vw - 1180px)/2));background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #DDDDDD}
.signal-strip>span:first-child,.signal-note{font:9px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#777777}.signal-strip b{font:700 11px 'Titillium Web',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#333333}.signal-strip i{font:12px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:#BDBDBD;font-style:normal}.signal-note{margin-left:auto}
.section-flow,.tools-section,.outcomes-section{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 56px));margin:0 auto;padding:90px 0}
.section-rail{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid #dce1e9;padding-top:15px;color:#777777;font-size:9px}
.section-rail span:first-child{color:#3d485b}
.flow-intro,.tools-heading,.outcomes-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .6fr;gap:50px;align-items:end;margin:32px 0 45px}
.flow-intro h2,.tools-heading h2,.outcomes-heading h2,.build-left h2{font:600 clamp(38px,4.8vw,61px)/1.01 'Titillium Web',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0;color:#111111}
.flow-intro h2 em,.tools-heading h2 em,.outcomes-heading h2 em,.build-left h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#8995a8}
.flow-intro>p,.tools-heading>p,.outcomes-heading>p,.build-left>p{font:15px/1.8 'Roboto',sans-serif;color:#657083;margin:0;max-width:465px}
.pipeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));border-top:1px solid #cfd7e1;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd7e1}
.pipeline-step{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 55px auto auto;gap:12px;padding:24px 21px 23px;text-decoration:none;border-right:1px solid #dfe4ec;transition:background .16s ease}
.pipeline-step:first-child{border-left:1px solid #dfe4ec}.pipeline-step:hover{background:#fff}
.pipeline-no{font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:#8c97a8}
.pipeline-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:47px;height:47px;background:#e9eef4;border:1px solid #d8e0ea;color:#1e364e;font:18px 'DM Mono',monospace}
.pipeline-content b{display:block;font:600 17px 'Titillium Web',sans-serif;color:#171f2d}.pipeline-content small{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:#667386;font:12px/1.65 'Roboto',sans-serif;max-width:190px}
.pipeline-arrow{position:absolute;right:20px;top:25px;color:#96a1b0;font-size:15px;transition:transform .15s}.pipeline-step:hover .pipeline-arrow{transform:translate(2px,-2px);color:#111}
.flow-footnote{display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr auto;gap:15px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e5ed;padding:22px 0 24px}
.footnote-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #cfd7e1;width:28px;height:28px;font:12px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:#68778b}.flow-footnote p{margin:0;font:12px/1.7 'Roboto',sans-serif;color:#667286}.flow-footnote p b{color:#212b3b}.flow-footnote a{font:600 11px 'Roboto',sans-serif;text-underline-offset:4px;color:#263c5a;white-space:nowrap}
.tools-section{padding-top:66px}
.tools-heading{margin-bottom:35px}
.tool-showcase{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.06fr .94fr;gap:24px 26px;align-items:start}
.tool-feature{min-width:0}.tool-feature-01{grid-row:span 2}.tool-feature-01 .tool-image-link{height:348px}.tool-feature-02 .tool-image-link,.tool-feature-03 .tool-image-link{height:215px}
.tool-screen{background:#111111;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #383838;box-shadow:0 14px 38px #00000012}
.tool-window-bar{height:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 11px;border-bottom:1px solid #333333;background:#191919;color:#bdbdbd;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.06em}
.window-lights{display:flex;gap:4px}.window-lights i{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#56657a}.window-lights i:first-child{background:#d58080}.window-lights i:nth-child(2){background:#d9bd6a}.window-lights i:nth-child(3){background:#81b887}
.tool-window-bar>a{margin-left:auto;color:#FFDB00;text-decoration:none;font-size:8px}
.tool-image-link{display:block;overflow:hidden;background:#f2f4f7}.tool-image-link img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:top center;transition:transform .25s ease}.tool-image-link:hover img{transform:scale(1.015)}
.tool-screen-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #273449;color:#76869f;font-size:8px}
.tool-description{display:grid;grid-template-columns:40px 1fr;gap:14px;padding:15px 0 0}
.tool-index{font:11px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:#667386;padding-top:3px}.tool-description h3{font:600 20px 'Titillium Web',sans-serif;color:#192233;margin:0 0 7px}.tool-description p{font:12px/1.7 'Roboto',sans-serif;color:#687488;margin:0;max-width:510px}.tool-description a{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font:600 11px 'Roboto',sans-serif;color:#263d5c;text-underline-offset:4px}
.build-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.92fr 1.08fr;background:#0b101a;color:#fff;padding:66px max(28px,calc((100vw - 1180px)/2));gap:clamp(28px,6vw,86px);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.build-section:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-200px;top:-260px;width:600px;height:600px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#1d2a41,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
.build-left{position:relative;z-index:1;align-self:center}.section-rail.light{border-top-color:#2d384b;color:#999999}.section-rail.light span:first-child{color:#dddddd}
.build-left h2{margin:32px 0 20px;color:white}.build-left h2 em{color:#9ba8bc}.build-left>p{color:#9ba9bd;margin-bottom:26px}
